{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"42ac7178cc2e2ab4","name":"card_unit_306th_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/USA/BloodIron/units/card_unit_306th_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"306th REGIMENT","text":"Deployment: Draw a card if you control another unit with 4 or more attack.","flavorText":"The 306th Infantry Regiment was a regiment of the 77th Infantry Division of the US Army during WWII. The division was ordered into active service in 1942 and trained in amphibious assaults and jungle warfare in preparation for the island-hopping campaigns against Japanese forces. The division saw major combat in battles such as Guam, Leyte, and Okinawa, where it fought in harsh conditions, often facing fierce resistance from entrenched Japanese positions. The 77th Division is especially famous for its role in the liberation of Guam in 1944, where it helped reclaim American territory occupied since 1941. Later, during the brutal Battle of Okinawa, the division continued to distinguish itself in one of the bloodiest battles of the Pacific, pushing through tough terrain and heavily fortified enemy positions.","faction":"USA","type":"infantry","rarity":"Common","cost":3,"operationCost":1,"attack":4,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_306th_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_306th_regiment_title","SourceString":"306th REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"306th REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":4,"defense":3,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::USA","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_306th_regiment_text","SourceString":"Deployment: Draw a card if you control another unit with 4 or more attack.","LocalizedString":"Deployment: Draw a card if you control another unit with 4 or more attack."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_306th_regiment_history","SourceString":"The 306th Infantry Regiment was a regiment of the 77th Infantry Division of the US Army during WWII. The division was ordered into active service in 1942 and trained in amphibious assaults and jungle warfare in preparation for the island-hopping campaigns against Japanese forces. The division saw major combat in battles such as Guam, Leyte, and Okinawa, where it fought in harsh conditions, often facing fierce resistance from entrenched Japanese positions. The 77th Division is especially famous for its role in the liberation of Guam in 1944, where it helped reclaim American territory occupied since 1941. Later, during the brutal Battle of Okinawa, the division continued to distinguish itself in one of the bloodiest battles of the Pacific, pushing through tough terrain and heavily fortified enemy positions.","LocalizedString":"The 306th Infantry Regiment was a regiment of the 77th Infantry Division of the US Army during WWII. The division was ordered into active service in 1942 and trained in amphibious assaults and jungle warfare in preparation for the island-hopping campaigns against Japanese forces. The division saw major combat in battles such as Guam, Leyte, and Okinawa, where it fought in harsh conditions, often facing fierce resistance from entrenched Japanese positions. The 77th Division is especially famous for its role in the liberation of Guam in 1944, where it helped reclaim American territory occupied since 1941. Later, during the brutal Battle of Okinawa, the division continued to distinguish itself in one of the bloodiest battles of the Pacific, pushing through tough terrain and heavily fortified enemy positions."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::BloodAndIron","extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment"],"draftBaseWeight":0.9,"hasDeployment":true,"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/Winter_2024/t_306th_regiment.t_306th_regiment","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Rebellion","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/306th_RE